      "content": {
        "type": "html",
        "html": "<section class=\"portfolio-section\">\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">The tools behind the windows</p>\n  <h2>My tech stack</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">My home turf is front-end development, with experience using the tools around it to build, test and ship complete features.</p>\n  <div class=\"stack-grid\">\n    <article class=\"stack-card\"><h3>Front end</h3><div class=\"tag-list\"><span>Vue 3</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>Pinia</span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"stack-card\"><h3>Tooling &amp; quality</h3><div class=\"tag-list\"><span>Vite</span><span>Vitest</span><span>ESLint</span><span>Prettier</span><span>Git</span><span>Docker</span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"stack-card\"><h3>Across the stack</h3><div class=\"tag-list\"><span>Django</span><span>Python</span><span>NestJS</span><span>TypeORM</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Redis</span></div></article>\n    <article class=\"stack-card\"><h3>Web to mobile</h3><div class=\"tag-list\"><span>REST APIs</span><span>Cordova</span><span>Firebase</span><span>Responsive UI</span><span>Accessibility</span></div></article>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"currently\"><strong>Currently:</strong> improving reusable components, cross-device experiences and the whole design-to-delivery process.</div>\n</section>"
      },
